      <h2>Frequently asked</h2>
      <h3>What if I just want the free audit?</h3>
      <p>Use <a href="/audit/" class="inline-link">/audit/</a>. The free version covers five points on two pages and is delivered in five business days. No card required. The two products are designed to coexist; the paid one is for buyers who want depth.</p>

      <h3>How is this different from a discovery call?</h3>
      <p>A <a href="/contact/" class="inline-link">discovery call</a> is twenty minutes, conversational, and is about whether we are a fit. The audit is a written diagnostic of your existing site, with metrics and prioritization. They are different products.</p>

      <h3>What if my site is on Wix / Squarespace / WordPress?</h3>
      <p>Doesn't matter for the audit. I evaluate the live site, not the platform. If the platform is part of the problem the audit will say so &mdash; but the deliverable is platform-agnostic findings.</p>

      <h3>Can the audit be a corporate purchase order?</h3>
      <p>Yes. Email me directly &mdash; I can invoice via Stripe with a PO number, with NET-15 terms.</p>
